  "adaptations": [
    "Promote the proven process-client admission/replication/movement/private-event path into NetworkClient.",
    "Bound receive work, keep protocol/phase/owner/channel checks and explicit connection failures.",
    "Map newer server timestamps and half RTT to monotonic presentation time, bounded to 250ms lead with 100ms remote interpolation delay.",
    "Retain original CMoveMgr cadence, fixed 60Hz client steps and six-step catchup with discarded-tick accounting.",
    "Preserve server-free client ownership; graphical frontend, weapon runtime, remote audio/FX consumers and full combat remain separate work."
  ]
